"Dental tourism packages in Istanbul — personalised, not one-size-fits-all"
msgstr "Tandresor till Istanbul – personliga, inte standardpaket"

#: apps/seo/package_views.py:72
msgid ""
"Dental work is more than a Hollywood smile. Your package is built around a "
"real diagnosis: assessment, treatment, transfers, hotel and aftercare."
msgstr ""
"Tandvård är mer än ett Hollywood-leende. Ditt paket bygger på en riktig "
"diagnos: undersökning, behandling, transfer, hotell och eftervård."

